<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank's Vanhala sees no ERM link at ECOFIN.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank's Vanhala sees no ERM link at ECOFIN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Finland board of management member Matti Vanhala on Wednesday told Reuters Financial Television (RFTV) he did not think the markka would be linked to the ERM at the September 20-22 ECOFIN meeting in Dublin.</p>
<p>&quot;I don't think so,&quot; Vanhala said when asked whether a decision to link the markka to the ERM might be topical at the weekend meeting of European Union finance ministers.  </p>
<p>&quot;I have no idea, frankly speaking,&quot; Vanhala said, asked when the decision would be made on a possible markka ERM-link.</p>
<p>&quot;It certainly has not been discussed with that sort of detail at all, it is not something that has been decided either way,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Vanhala earlier told a news conference in Helsinki all options on ERM were still open for Finland.</p>
<p>    --Helsinki Newsroom   +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
